  "thumbnail": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551269901-5c3b16b12d30?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop",
  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "The knife parry (timed block against melee attacks) is the primary defensive skill—a successful parry staggers the attacker into a vulnerable counter-window lasting 1.5 seconds, enabling a free melee finisher or shotgun point-blank shot.",
      "Merchant inventory rotates chapter-by-chapter—check the Exclusive Upgrades menu at every merchant encounter, as high-value exclusives (Bolt Thrower exclusive, Shotgun Exclusive) appear only in specific chapters and become unavailable afterward.",
      "Selling treasures with gemstone sockets requires completing the combination first—inserting a gemstone matching the highlighted socket color before selling increases treasure sale value by 30–80% above base price.",
      "Ashley protection strategy: she can hide in dumpsters during scripted enemy waves—position her in the nearest dumpster at the start of each large encounter, engage enemies fully without monitoring her position, then retrieve her after the wave clears.",
      "The Chicago Sweeper (fully upgraded) and Handcannon are Professional mode-exclusive unlocks that carry NG+ statistics—do not try to unlock them mid-first-playthrough as they require completing Professional difficulty first."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "ナイフパリィ（近接攻撃への時間指定ブロック）は主要な防御スキル。成功したパリィは攻撃者を1.5秒間の脆弱な反撃ウィンドウにたたらせ、無料の近接フィニッシャーまたはショットガンの接近射撃が可能になる。",
      "商人の在庫は章ごとに変わる。全商人エンカウントでエクスクルーシブアップグレードメニューを確認する。高価値のエクスクルーシブ（ボルトスローワー、ショットガン）は特定の章にのみ表示され、その後は入手不可になる。",
      "ジェムソケット付きのトレジャーを売る前に組み合わせを完成させる。売る前に強調表示されたソケットカラーに合わせてジェムを挿入すると、ベース価格より30〜80%高い売値になる。",
      "アシュリー保護戦略：スクリプトされた敵の波の間、ダストボックスに隠れることができる。各大型エンカウントの開始時に最も近いダストボックスに彼女を配置し、彼女の位置を監視せずに敵と全力で交戦し、波が終わった後に彼女を回収する。",
      "シカゴスイーパー（完全アップグレード済み）とハンドキャノンはプロフェッショナルモード専用のアンロックで、NG+統計を引き継ぐ。プロフェッショナル難易度を完了する必要があるため、初回プレイスルー中にアンロックしようとしない。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Village Chapter Resource Management",
        "body": "The opening Village encounter (Chapter 1) is a survival section—the goal is surviving for approximately 3.5 minutes, not killing all enemies. Use the shotgun early on the chainsaw man to avoid his one-shot mechanic, then transition to avoiding rather than fighting. Conserve handgun ammo for the rest of the chapter where precision shots (knee shots for stunlock, headshots for drops) matter more. Craft Shotgun Shells (Gunpowder + Shotgun Shells recipe) to maintain ammo through the Village chapter."
      },
      {
        "title": "Merchant Upgrade Priority",
        "body": "In the first 5 chapters, upgrade in this order: Handgun Power (2–3 upgrades, increases stagger rate), Knife Durability (upgrade all tiers—knife parries drain durability and the knife breaks permanently without repairs at the merchant), Shotgun Firepower (1 upgrade for higher stagger). Avoid investing in Suppressor upgrades early—silencer attachments reduce noise at the cost of muzzle velocity, which decreases effective range against key enemies in Chapter 6 and later."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Regenerador Strategy",
        "body": "Regeneradors (Chapter 12+) require Infrared Scope to reveal and destroy their internal Plagas. Acquire the Infrared Scope from the Freezer section before encountering the first Regenerador. Target the Plagas visible through the scope (appear as orange glowing masses)—destroying all internal Plagas disables the regeneration entirely. Without the scope, Regeneradors require 20+ rifle shots to temporary-stagger, making them effectively unkillable without massive ammo investment."
      },
      {
        "title": "Island Chapter Loadout Shift",
        "body": "From Chapter 13 (Island section) onward, enemy composition shifts heavily toward armoured Commandos—shotguns and the Chicago Sweeper (SMG) become the primary weapons. Begin transitioning your ammo reserves toward Shotgun Shells and SMG ammo at the Chapter 12 merchant before entering the Island. Handgun ammo remains secondary for precision stagger but primary handgun use becomes inefficient against armoured units."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "Separate Ways DLC and NG+ Planning",
        "body": "Separate Ways DLC (Ada Wong) plays parallel to RE4 Remake's main timeline and provides context for key plot moments. It introduces the hook-and-grapple mechanic not present in the base game. Completing Separate Ways adds exclusive Outfits for Leon and Ada usable in the main game NG+. For NG+ planning: sell all treasures before the final boss fight and spend the Pesetas on upgrading the Handcannon or Chicago Sweeper to their EX Exclusive status, which provides infinite ammo on those specific weapons."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Attempting to kill all enemies in every encounter—ammo is scarce and replenishment depends on treasure selling, not enemy drops; conserve ammo by using melee stunlocks (kick, suplex) rather than shooting at close range.",
      "Not repairing the combat knife at the merchant—knife durability depletes with parries and stealth kills; a broken knife cannot parry, losing the primary defensive mechanic for the rest of the chapter.",
      "Selling the Biosensor Scope before the Island section—the Biosensor Scope reveals enemy HP on screen; this is invaluable in the Island for tracking Regenerador Plaga destruction status.",
      "Neglecting the Blue Medallion side challenges—Blue Medallions are distributed across each area and reward Spinel gems when shot in groups of 5; Spinel gems are the highest-value tradable item and fund the most expensive merchant upgrades.",
      "Entering the final chapter without a fully charged knife—the knife is the primary tool against Krauser (boss in Chapter 14) during his melee section; a low-durability knife breaks mid-fight and loses the counter-window advantage."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "全てのエンカウントで全ての敵を倒そうとする。弾薬は不足しており、補充はトレジャー売却に依存し、敵のドロップには依存しない。近接でのスタン攻撃（キック、スープレックス）を使って接近戦での射撃を減らして弾薬を節約する。",
      "商人でコンバットナイフを修理しない。ナイフの耐久性はパリィとステルスキルで消耗する。壊れたナイフはパリィできず、残りの章の主要防御メカニックを失う。",
      "アイランドセクション前にバイオセンサースコープを売る。バイオセンサースコープは画面に敵のHPを表示する。これはアイランドでのレヘネラドールのプラーガ破壊ステータスの追跡に非常に役立つ。",
      "ブルーメダリオンのサイドチャレンジを無視する。ブルーメダリオンは各エリアに分布しており、5個のグループで射撃するとスピネルジェムを報酬として与える。スピネルジェムは最高価値の取引可能なアイテムで、最も高価な商人のアップグレードに資金を提供する。",
      "完全にチャージされたナイフなしで最終章に入る。ナイフはクラウザー戦（第14章ボス）の近接セクション中の主要ツール。耐久性の低いナイフは戦闘中に破損し、カウンターウィンドウの有利を失う。"
